            <description><![CDATA[
<ul>
  <li><b>Unlock when you come back.</b> MacAway can type your password when you walk back to your Mac. It is off until you turn it on in the gear menu, and it works only after your phone or watch has been away.</li>
  <li><b>Modes you can name.</b> Home and In public are now Normal and Strict, with the same numbers you had. Rename them, change them, or add your own.</li>
  <li><b>A warning when a lock keeps nobody out.</b> If your Mac waits a minute or more before it asks for your password, the menu now tells you.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
